WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Two nearby initial positions. Both runs start in mode q = 1.

00:03.000 --> 00:23.000
Run A passes to the left of the obstacle. Mode q = 1 remains active.

00:23.000 --> 00:28.000
Run B approaches the hysteresis threshold. Model time is slowed to inspect the event.

00:28.000 --> 00:30.000
At t = 0.25185 s, V1 - V2 = 0.150087, exceeding the threshold 0.15.

00:30.000 --> 00:34.000
The mode jumps from q = 1 to q = 2. The switching gap resets to zero; position remains continuous.

00:34.000 --> 00:51.000
Run B continues with V2 and passes to the right of the obstacle.

00:51.000 --> 01:06.000
Synchronized comparison: opposite routes, the same source. Colors indicate the actual active mode.
